# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Client data, local state and repository history.
#
# The Dockerfile runs `COPY --link . .`, so anything not excluded here is baked
# into the image. data/, uploads/ and eval/ hold real client records and source
# images, and .git/ holds the full history. None of it belongs in a runtime
# image. The application recreates data/ and uploads/ at startup with
# mkdirSync({ recursive: true }), so excluding them is safe.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.git/
.github/
.claude/
data/
uploads/
eval/
sample_data/
test-data/
archive/
analysis/
backups/
venv/
junit.xml
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.zip
*.7z
*.pdf
*.PDF

# Generated public-mirror export
.mirror-export/
